r la r&#233;duction de desserte, des trains marqueront des arr&#234;ts suppl&#233;mentaires dans certaines gares.<br><br>Les &#233;quipes restent mobilis&#233;es pour un retour &#224; la normale au cours de l'automne pour l'axe Conflans-Sainte-Honorine.<br><br>Retrouvez chaque vendredi d&#232;s 17h les horaires des trains qui circuleront la semaine suivante sur la rubrique \"Recherche Itin&#233;raire\". Nous vous recommandons &#233;galement de v&#233;rifier vos horaires avant de vous rendre en gare.<br><br>Pour plus d&#8217;informations rendez vous sur le <a href=\"https:\/\/malignej.transilien.com\/2026\/08\/28\/ligne-j-point-de-situation-sur-le-plan-de-transport-de-rentree\/\">Blog Ligne J<\/a><\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic perturbé","impactedSections":[{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01739","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71370","name":"Gare Saint-Lazare (Paris)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:74348","name":"Gisors (Gisors)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01739","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71370","name":"Gare Saint-Lazare (Paris)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:65931","name":"Mantes-la-Jolie (Mantes-la-Jolie)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01739","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:74348","name":"Gisors (Gisors)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71370","name":"Gare Saint-Lazare (Paris)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01739","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:65931","name":"Mantes-la-Jolie (Mantes-la-Jolie)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71370","name":"Gare Saint-Lazare (Paris)"}}],"disruption_id":"2c4a9646-1462-4037-9538-57a5a9446152"},{"id":"e79f7fff-2c35-4afa-82a8-fdc03b6e85c4","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260629T161600","end":"20281231T200000"}],"lastUpdate":"20260831T153045","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","title":"Travaux","message":"<p>L'arrêt Capitaine Glarner est non desservi<\/p>"}],"lines":[{"id":"line:IDFM:C01371","name":"1","shortName":"1","